  unitName: Parch Misfit Malef
  unitId: 10936
  unitNumber: 1434
  description: After long years of demonic research intended to create the ultimate
    being, Malef eventually succeeded in creating a demon with immense power and
    a weak sense of self. Following this success, he attacked his fellow researcher
    in order to keep the results for himself. Although he succeeded in killing his
    partner, he was left on the edge of death by her counterattack. He was later
    rescued by the female demon who ruled Lem, and chose to be used by her in order
    to continue his research.
  summonDesc: It looks like I have a new test subject. You just stay asleep, and
    leave everything to me!
  fusionDesc: This technique...it's fascinating! I've got to incorporate it into
    my demon and power it up right away!
